      "text": "Step 2: Determine the area of the shaded region.\nThe shaded region is $\\frac{5}{12}$ of the area of the larger circle. Thus, the area of the shaded region is $\\frac{5}{12} \\times 4\\pi = \\frac{5\\pi}{3}$.",
