      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Step 3: Express the area of the shaded region in terms of sector areas.\nThe shaded region consists of a sector of the larger circle minus a sector of the smaller circle. Let $\\theta$ be the measure of $\\angle ADC$ in radians. The area of the sector of the larger circle is $\\frac{1}{2} \\times 2^2 \\times \\theta = 2\\theta$. The area of the sector of the smaller circle is $\\frac{1}{2} \\times 1^2 \\times \\theta = \\frac{1}{2}\\theta$.",
